    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> You must be utilizing Zephyr Style</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1-3 Focus</p><p>You bend like a reed in the wind.</p><p>When an enemy makes an attack against you, you may spend <strong>-1 Focus</strong> before the attack is rolled to impose <strong>Disadvantage</strong> on the attack.</p><p>Alternatively, you may spend <strong>-3 Focus</strong> to impose <strong>Greater Disadvantage</strong> on the attack.</p><p>If the attack misses, you may immediately move up to <strong>2 spaces</strong>. This movement does not trigger attacks or effects that respond to your movement.</p>",
